              <tr>
                  <td class="sub-title">Anticipated Completion date</td>
                  <td style="width: 40%;">The date upon which the Seller reasonably estimates that Completion is to occur. Without prejudice to the Seller’s rights in respect of Force Majeure Event and/ or Delay Events, the Anticipated Completion Date may be extended by the Seller, in its absolute discretion without cause, by written notice to the Buyer for a period or periods of up to a total of twelve (12) months.</td>
