              <tr>
                  <td style="text-align: center;"><strong>DECLARATION OF ADHERENCE TO THE MASTER COMMUNITY DECLARATION</strong></td>
                  <td class="ar-lang" style="text-align: center;"><strong>إعلان الالتزام بإعلان المجمع الرئيسي</strong></td>
