              </tr>
              <tr>
                 <td>The Buyer’s attention is drawn towards its obligation, in accordance with Law No. 7 of 2006, Law No. 13 of 2008 and other applicable laws and with the SPA, to register the SPA in the Interim Real Estate Register or the Real Estate Register (as appropriate) within the stipulated timeline with the payment of the requisite fees as applicable failing which the Seller shall have absolute rights to terminate the reservation and forfeit the payments done till date without further notice.</td>
